The committed Noto files (scripts_handwriting/fonts/*-subset.ttf) are Modified
Versions under the licence: a static instance of each variable font, subset to
the characters the pages use, renamed "<family> Subset", with every name record
holding a Reserved Font Name removed. scripts_handwriting/fonts.py makes them
from the source files. Caveat and Patrick Hand are committed unmodified and are
used only to draw page pictures. No full source font file is committed.

The Vision-layer documents also embed a glyphless font that
scripts_handwriting/vision.py generates (one empty glyph per recognised
character); it is part of this repository's Apache-2.0 code.
